But wait, since this is the only digit, does that mean the result is 52_8? So, 6_8 times 7_8 is 52_8. That matches what I got when I converted to base 10.

Let me double-check by adding 6_8 five times in base 8 to see if it equals 52_8.

So, 6_8 + 6_8 + 6_8 + 6_8 + 6_8.

